  "full_text": "So, with any luck, maybe God will say who to kill. Like, first of all, if God is talking in a public oracle, I should just keep that. If I just keep God talking in public, that should accomplish a lot. Because, first of all, he can talk and say stuff. I'm going to sing some songs. I was in a Dixieland. Yeah, I said my name was Collins. No, it's not. Davis Collins. Mostly just Davis. So, yeah, I've been king for a while. Like, radio's always talking to me. So, well. So, yeah, let's just keep God talking in the public oracle. And if he decided to, maybe he'll say what to do. He won't say what to do. But at least it'll influence public opinion. just keep god talking in the public oracle it seems like uh he has a way of building uh trust and uh that should do it right there um maybe no god said uh it wasn't gonna happen like automatically so so like uh during reagan we watched red dawn um red dawn the the occupation of america by russians so that's what like as a teenager all the american kids Formed into Red Dawn units like there was Carlos and Leo and first of all Dan Davey and I had a Dan Davey got me he was an Air Force brat and this is in 1984 during the Reagan Red Dawn years and We had BB gun fights and So like then like I got my friends together The Air Force brats go to other places every couple of years. And then like my later friends, we had like five people and we had BB gun fights. And so like, because like everybody back then was like fantasizing about Red Dawn and stuff like that. So go watch the original movie. They did a remake. You can bet the CIA is trying to cover their tracks. The original is a lot better, I'm sure. So there you go.",
